Booking Confirmed

<% if @user == @booking.user %>
Hello <%= @user.first_name || @user.email %>,

Great news! Your booking has been confirmed.
<% else %>
A booking has been confirmed.
<% end %>

Booking Details:
- Booking ID: #<%= @booking.id.to_s.first(8) %>
- Product: <%= @booking.product_name || @product&.name || "N/A" %>
- Period: <%= @booking.start_at.strftime("%B %d, %Y") %> - <%= @booking.end_at.strftime("%B %d, %Y") %>
- Total: <%= number_to_currency(@booking.total_price) %>

Confirmed Items:
<% items_to_show = @fulfillment ? @booking_items : @booking.booking_items.includes(variant_stock: { variant_options: :images }) %>
<% items_to_show.each do |item| %>
- <%= item.variant_stock_option_names || "Item" %>
  Quantity: <%= item.quantity %>
  Price: <%= number_to_currency(item.price) %>
  <% if item.variant_stock_warehouse_name %>Warehouse: <%= item.variant_stock_warehouse_name %><% end %>
<% end %>

<% if @user == @booking.user %>
We're preparing your items and will notify you once they're ready for dispatch.
<% else %>
The booking has been confirmed and is ready for processing.
<% end %>

View your booking: <%= @booking_url %>

Best regards,
The Platinum Vault Team
